---
description: Decide field-level findings for identifyOptions.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Generate practical alternatives such as scheduling, shared responsibilities, or differentiated use. Preserve each participant’s stated constraints, disclose concessions, and include the option of no agreement rather than manufacturing consensus or pressuring acceptance. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
